        "w": 24,
        "h": 2
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "k6 runs with `--out experimental-prometheus-rw` to `http://prometheus.monitoring.svc.cluster.local:9090/api/v1/write`, tagged `testid`. Trend metrics need `K6_PROMETHEUS_RW_TREND_STATS=p(50),p(90),p(95),p(99),avg,max` (k6 only sends p99 by default); see the README."
